        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          121      Kalum Dikho Pou' Jisu ta",
            "                        8.8.11.6. 12.12.Ref. 10. 7. 10. 6",
            "",
            "                     Kalum di kho Pou' Jisu ta,",
            "                     Thuancku di kho Pou' Jisu ta.",
            "                     Ata gulou khangrui guang the kandih khou.",
            "                     Paapc khourui gulou the.",
            "                     Kathancmei lwmgaymei, kathancmei apanty",
            "                     Tiguanhlou the ata Hellelujah Amen.",
            "",
            "          1. Cross ruc khou zei rui apaap kuaklouna",
            "             Kaguay ta swthanlou the.",
            "             Nang bumaengc ta nic swthanlou pwni.",
            "             Nang rui lwmlou ethei.",
            "",
            "          2. Gutlou tho nang aseic Poubauhmei khou",
            "             Guloumei laatow khangrui.",
            "             Nang bumaengc tei katuang tiswlou o,",
            "             Tingsaeng zaeng ringc pwni.",
            "",
            "          3. Poubauhmei Jisu guang dat pwni the,",
            "             Ata laa dat khangruina.",
            "             Aram lum hei kalaic dat zat lak khe",
            "             Poubauhmei guang mak saanv.",
            "",
            "          4. Ai hei tingsaeng zaengna bam pwni the.",
            "             Ryanraa kalanghmei maekna,",
            "             Tingkauh baancharaa guay lev neihlaa 'chamcna",
            "             Tingsaeng zaeng ringc pwni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
